    [Bondi-class] the capture SURFACE of the gravitational focus: A_cap ~ pi r_BHL^2 with r_BHL = G M/v_circ^2 ~ R500/2 ~ M500^(1/3) (the isothermal well IS its own Bondi surface) at the fixed stream speed (v_ff = sqrt(2) sigma_ph universal, G182) -> dM/dt ~ A_cap ~ M500^(2/3) -> alpha_supply = 2/3

